# Pinned agent image versions (2026.<m>.<d>-g<sha> — consistent with the deploy versioning). Sourced by
# agents/{agent-session,coordinator-session,reviewer-session}.sh; the coordinator image's in-cluster
# manifests take the same tag from agents/coordinator/kustomization.yaml `newTag` (FU-152 — one pin,
# one file per consumer kind). Bumped by the image repos' deploy-pin PRs (agent-runtime →
# AGENT_BASE_IMAGE, agent-coordinator → AGENT_COORDINATOR_IMAGE + newTag). Pinned (NOT :latest) →
# k8s uses imagePullPolicy IfNotPresent by default (no pullAlways), cacheable, traceable to the
# build commit.
#
# ⚠ NO TWO PIN LINES ADJACENT (homelab#2014 follow-through, 2026-10-10). A version-set stamp
# rebuilds agent-base AND agent-coordinator at once, so their two deploy-pin PRs are open together,
# forked from the same master. git conflicts on ADJACENT changed lines even when they are
# different lines (#2454 merged, #2455 went DIRTY and needed a human); one unchanged line between
# them makes the second PR merely BEHIND, which the updater (agents/update-pr-branch.sh) brings
# current on its own. Each pin therefore keeps its own comment line above it. Replayed by
# agents/replay/fixtures/images-env-concurrent-pins (every pair of pins, both orders).

# agent-base — worker/fixer pods (agent-runtime's deploy-pin).
AGENT_BASE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/teststuffstash/agent-base:2026.10.10-g5d8d18d24ebb.102
# agent-coordinator — coordinator/reviewer/reflex pods (agent-coordinator's deploy-pin).
AGENT_COORDINATOR_IMAGE=ghcr.io/teststuffstash/agent-coordinator:2026.10.10-gd303a3b5bd8d
# dind sidecar for docker-mode workers (AgentStack fixer.docker; docs/spikes/kata-ci-gate.md).
# Digest-pinned: the mutable :5-dind tag cost the kata spike 3 attempts of confounders.
AGENT_DIND_IMAGE=ghcr.io/k3d-io/k3d:5-dind@sha256:ee3872700ed070566d3680e4926d8d60b1f0d3a948e595fec52103c2ae758921
